flowchart LR
    Developer[Developer] -->|Reviewed change| Repo[Source Repository]

    Repo --> Pipeline[CI/CD Security Pipeline]
    Pipeline -->|Secret and source checks| SourceGate[Source Security Gate]
    Pipeline -->|Image and SBOM checks| SupplyGate[Supply-Chain Gate]
    Pipeline -->|Policy evaluation| PolicyGate[Policy Gate]

    PolicyGate -->|Approved change| Cluster[Local Kubernetes Cluster]
    PolicyGate -->|Rejected change| Feedback[Actionable Security Feedback]

    User[Authenticated User] -->|OIDC flow| IdP[Keycloak OIDC Provider]
    IdP -->|Validated tokens| Cluster

    Cluster --> Workloads[Hardened Workloads]
    Workloads -->|Restricted traffic| Data[Controlled Data Services]
    Workloads -->|Audit events| Monitoring[Monitoring and Governance]

    Monitoring --> Collector[Platform State Collector]
    Collector --> Baseline[Approved Security Baseline]
    Baseline --> Drift[Compliance and Drift Decision]

    Backup[Backup Artifact] --> Integrity[SHA-256 Integrity Validation]
    Integrity -->|Verified input| Restore[Isolated Restoration Workspace]
    Integrity -->|Tampered input| Reject[Recovery Rejection]

    Cluster --> Backup
    Restore --> Recovery[Recovery Validation Evidence]

    subgraph B1[Trust Boundary: Developer and Repository]
        Developer
        Repo
    end

    subgraph B2[Trust Boundary: Delivery Pipeline]
        Pipeline
        SourceGate
        SupplyGate
        PolicyGate
    end

    subgraph B3[Trust Boundary: Runtime Platform]
        Cluster
        Workloads
        Data
    end

    subgraph B4[Trust Boundary: Identity]
        User
        IdP
    end

    subgraph B5[Trust Boundary: Governance and Recovery]
        Monitoring
        Collector
        Baseline
        Drift
        Backup
        Integrity
        Restore
        Reject
        Recovery
    end
